        "| 2  | e        |\n",
        "| 3  | `SPACE`        |\n",
        "| 4  | P     |\n",
        "\n",
        "where the P in index 4 is the start of the word Project!\n",
        "\n",
        "Now that we know how `find` works, let's use it to find the starting and ending indices for the main body of text."
      ],
